        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (revised): Simulate drawing one tile at a time and use a set to keep track of the current state of the hand, checking for mentsu formation after each draw. If no mentsu is found after drawing one tile, continue trying other tiles without prematurely returning 2. Instead, try drawing another tile and repeat the process until a mentsu is found or all possible tiles have been drawn.",
